WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.330
Revelation is not a straight line. Think of it as a spiral.

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:19.420
Seven letters, seven seals, seven trumpets, seven bowls: each round goes over the same ground again, and a little deeper.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:26.350
It begins among lamps in a dark world and ends in a garden city full of light.
